  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n{暗算|あんざん}する is used as a する verb meaning \"to calculate mentally.\"\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n{暗|あん} (dark, hidden) + {算|ざん} (calculation). The idea is calculating \"in the dark\" — without visible aids.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {暗算|あんざん}で{計算|けいさん}する (to calculate mentally)\n- {暗算|あんざん}が{得意|とくい} / {苦手|にがて} (good/bad at mental math)\n- {暗算|あんざん}{検定|けんてい} (mental arithmetic proficiency test)",
